WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.569
-New White House Press Secretary
Kayleigh McEnany

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.269
has been holding a lot
of press briefings lately,

00:00:04.269 --> 00:00:05.638
but she seems to avoid

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.807
answering the questions
we need answered most,

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:09.775
so we decided to hold another
one right here, right now.

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:13.146
That's right, Kayleigh McEnany
is here and ready to go,

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:14.713
so, without further ado,
it's time

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:17.316
for the Late Night
White House Press Briefing.

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:25.058
♪♪

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:27.126
Yes! Yes, thank you.
Seth Meyers,

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.260
"Late Night with Seth Meyers."

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.530
Secretary McEnany,
do you have any update

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.932
on the number
of new COVID cases today?

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.768
-They went like this, and that's
thanks to President Trump.

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:37.870
-And, yes,
where's the safest place

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.239
for Americans to be, right now,

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:41.240
to avoid catching
the coronavirus?

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.641
-The rest of the world.

00:00:42.641 --> 00:00:45.445
-What would you say has been
Trump's biggest nemesis, so far,

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:47.480
when it comes to his
response to the pandemic?

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.415
-Reality.
-What were the results

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:51.317
of President Trump's
last physical?

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.953
-We have beef operating
at 98% capacity,

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:58.057
pork at 95%,
and poultry at 98%.

00:00:58.057 --> 00:00:59.225
-June was Pride Month.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.094
Does President Trump even know

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:02.495
which people it celebrates?

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.630
-FQHCs.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:08.735
-Oh! Almost. LGBTQs.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:13.506
We were looking for LGBTQs.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.408
When you interviewed
for the job,

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.510
what kind of questions
did they ask you?

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.911
-Not one question.

00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:21.047
I didn't receive one question.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.382
-If President Trump
hadn't cheated on his SATs,

00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:25.551
what school could he
have gotten into?

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:27.319
-Let's say
University of Phoenix.

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:29.622
-How many French fries
does the president eat?

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.557
-About 500,000 per day.

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:34.193
-Now that a Trump appointee
is running the U.S. post office,

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:35.528
what will their new slogan be?

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.096
-I can't promise you
it's tomorrow,

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:40.132
but, in the coming days,
we look to deliver that.

00:01:40.132 --> 00:01:42.135
-Kayleigh,
how does Mitch McConnell

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.070
keep his neck skin
under control?

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.071
-Incredibly strong ties.

00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:49.142
-Where will President Trump
have his eventual,

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:50.977
complete nervous breakdown?

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:52.311
-On Twitter, for all to see.

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:54.447
-Why are there so many people

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.849
with Confederate flags
at Trump rallies?

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:58.017
-We hand them out.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.652
-What does Trump say
when he goes to a Denny's

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.821
and there's a maze
on the back of a place mat?

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:03.923
-Where do you draw
the line here?

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:06.092
-Melania Trump
was raised Catholic.

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.893
Why did Trump decide not

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:10.230
to join the Catholic Church
when they got married?

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.098
-He's not a fan of the kneeling.

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:13.733
-Is there a mnemonic
device you use

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:16.402
to remember Trump's lunch order
of a cheeseburger,

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:17.903
Ho Hos, Oreos, and a Pepsi?

00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:20.473
-CHOP, C-H-O-P.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.575
-I heard President Trump
is writing a parenting book.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.609
What's it called?

00:02:23.609 --> 00:02:25.378
-The negative impacts
of children.

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:28.748
-What does it mean when the
manager walks out to the mound,

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:32.718
looks to the bullpen,
and taps his left arm like this?

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:35.221
-Bring in Cy Vance, a Democrat.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.157
-What is Jared Kushner's role
in this administration?

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:39.659
-Important tool.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:43.129
-What was Rosebud,
from the movie "Citizen Kane"?

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:44.764
-It's a comment
that he made in passing.

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:46.732
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:46.732 --> 00:02:48.934
I see what you did
there, Kayleigh.

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:51.670
What does Trump call using
the McDonald's drive-through?

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.539
-People attending church
in their cars?

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:56.308
-What happens when Donald Trump

00:02:56.308 --> 00:02:59.312
comes up to a door
labeled "Pull"?

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:01.947
-The president,
he's going to push.

00:03:01.947 --> 00:03:04.449
-Tell me a scary story
about Trump being president.

00:03:04.449 --> 00:03:05.652
-He wants to do it again.

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:07.886
-Aah!

00:03:07.886 --> 00:03:11.690
When was Major League Baseball
the most fun to watch?

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:13.392
-When steroids were used.

00:03:13.392 --> 00:03:15.061
Is it true
that President Trump thinks

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.763
he's a better saxophone-playing
president than Bill Clinton?

00:03:17.763 --> 00:03:19.432
-He believes it'd go a long way

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:22.101
if Bubba came out
and acknowledged that.

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:23.369
-What did President Trump say

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:26.038
when Kentucky Fried Chicken
changed its name to KFC?

00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:28.074
-We've gotta honor
what has happened there,

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:29.241
not rename it.

00:03:29.241 --> 00:03:30.243
-Alright, Kayleigh, be honest.

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:33.813
What would you guess my role was

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.814
on the high school
football team?

00:03:35.814 --> 00:03:37.350
-Absolute nonstarter.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.319
-Anh, you're not wrong.

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:40.452
Well, you're a little wrong.

00:03:40.452 --> 00:03:43.089
I wasn't even on the team.

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:44.657
If Trump gets reelected,
do you think we'll see

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.826
all Four Horsemen
of the Apocalypse appear?

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:47.893
-There will be, I think, five.

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:49.361
-Five? Oh.

00:03:49.361 --> 00:03:50.730
That'll be somethin'.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.398
What should I make,
in order to make sure

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:55.167
I get a table at a restaurant
that allows indoor dining,

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:56.735
doesn't require
social distancing,

00:03:56.735 --> 00:03:58.171
and doesn't require masks?

00:03:58.171 --> 00:04:00.006
-They're grave reservations.

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:02.375
-Grave, grave reservations.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.143
Did you guys hear that?

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:05.611
Oh, I'm the only?

00:04:05.611 --> 00:04:07.646
I'm the only one here?

00:04:07.646 --> 00:04:09.181
Looks like we have time
for one more question,

00:04:09.181 --> 00:04:10.583
so I'll make it
an important one.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:15.220
If you could watch any two
people from history bone,

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.822
Who would you choose?

00:04:16.822 --> 00:04:19.058
-Susan B. Anthony
and Billy Graham.

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:20.960
-Wow! Alright.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.261
Thank you for your
honesty, Kayleigh.

00:04:22.261 --> 00:04:23.696
And it looks like we're
out of time, so, on behalf

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:25.898
of the rest the Late Night
Press Corps, have a good night.

